 "brief": "A flat joiner that links two 25 mm webbing straps end to end, MJF PA12. It is a plate 4 mm thick (z = 0 to 4) inside x = -18 to 18, y = -16 to 16, with two slots for the webbing, each 27 x 4 mm with 1.5 mm corner radii, through the plate at y = 4 to 8 and y = -8 to -4 (x = -13.5 to 13.5). Each strap loops through its slot and round the outer bar, so a strap pulls the outer bar's slot-side edge outward along the strap. The straps pull 300 N apart along Y. Safety factor 2.",
